{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>STILMORY 是一款構圖相機，讓你在按下快門前先以可移動的取景窗決定畫面範圍，適合喜歡精準控制構圖與細節的攝影愛好者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>取景窗先構圖再決定畫面</h2>\n<p>以可移動取景窗先構圖，再決定按下快門的一刻。開啟 PAIR 模式，同一瞬間可同時保留完整場景與所選細節，並輸出 Scene + Detail 對照版面。拍攝前可選 3:4、1:1 或 9:16，並查看預期輸出細節。內置 11 種 Look 風格可於取景器預覽並調整強度，拍攝時直接套用，無需帳戶或雲端渲染。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-141-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-142-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-143-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-144-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-145-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-146-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：STILMORY</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T02:18:53.946606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T02:05:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T03:18:05.823527+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"eb4e2636fe445300d8579ead820ba5b37e471f52760800f8f42b895131471252","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}